# Leave unset (or empty) to run the dashboard against the bundled sample
# data (see src/lib/queryEngine.ts) — the default, since the live API is
# torn down. Set this to switch to a real deployment, e.g. the output of
# `terraform output -raw api_endpoint` (minus the trailing slash):
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://xxxxxxxxxx.execute-api.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com
